OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry
OL,6,Finitially this evening in the east,
OL,7,Fbut rain in the west will spread
OL,8,Facross the region. The rain heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes with strengthening winds,
OL,10,Fpossible coastal gales, before
OL,11,Fclearing to showers in the far west by
OL,12,Fdawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA day of sunshine and
OL,15,Fblustery showers. These turning heavy
OL,16,Fat times and pushing eastwards. A
OL,17,Flittle cooler but still warm in the
OL,18,Fsunshine with winds also easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
