OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,6,Fshowers clearing on Thursday to sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Rain returns on Friday, before
OL,8,Fturning drier and brighter Saturday
OL,9,Fonce early fog clears. Temperatures
OL,10,Freturning nearer to average for early
OL,11,FOctober.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
